@startuml
title Sequence — leave approval and live timetable
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Teacher browser" as P0
participant "Flask routes" as P1
participant "Admin browser" as P2
participant "Leave / proxy modules" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
P0 -> P1: POST /apply_leave + form / CSRF
P1 -> P4: Create Pending leave + admin notification; commit
P1 --> P0: Redirect to teacher dashboard
P2 -> P1: POST /admin/approve_leave/<leave_id>
P1 -> P3: approve_leave(leave_id, institute_code)
P3 -> P4: Load Pending leave; stage Approved status
P3 -> P4: Read affected master blocks, teachers and workload
P4 --> P3: Session blocks and candidate information
loop [for every affected session block]
P3 -> P3: find_best_proxy(...)
alt [eligible proxy found]
P3 -> P4: Stage dated proxy rows + teacher notification
else [no eligible proxy]
P3 -> P4: Stage dated __UNCOVERED__ rows
end
end
P3 -> P4: Commit approved leave and all overrides
P3 --> P1: Success / message (rollback on exception)
P1 --> P2: Redirect to leave requests
P0 -> P1: GET /teacher_dash
P1 -> P4: Read master and current-week dated entries
P4 --> P1: Rows for effective schedule merge
P1 --> P0: Rendered Live Week timetable
@enduml
